    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> </span><strong><span>1万亿美元到底有多少？你其实毫无概念，不信来测</span></strong></p><p><span>把1万亿美元具像化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">00:06:37</a> </span><strong><span>盘点SpaceX IPO最大赢家们</span></strong></p><p><span>凭借手中持有的这家火箭制造商股份，从资深高管到短期员工，再到大学捐赠基金与风投机构，各路投资者都获利丰厚。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">00:09:51</a> </span><strong><span>SpaceX上市：马斯克的"最"字诀</span></strong></p><p><span>SpaceX或许永远无法兑现对投资者的所有承诺，但它已经实现了最初的目标：重燃人类对太空探索的兴趣。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">00:16:06</a></span><strong><span> SpaceX——太空创业圈的"黄埔军校"</span></strong></p><p><span>从2吨级卫星到激光通信、太空机动飞船，美国太空初创企业正吸引新一轮投资热潮。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnuBKgbEnUDq9620Z5Bb2BPE-ly.jpg"><p><span>IPO期间，马斯克在德克萨斯州发表远程讲话。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvkon0ApQSt-9Dx9yZBGVlkaRYT3.jpg"><p><span>SpaceX总裁肖特韦尔，她一直是马斯克的坚定捍卫者。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSjqPIcFt_-_xabK2SVvGyLkucW.jpg"><p><span>5月，蓝色起源的一枚火箭发生爆炸，导致该公司位于佛罗里达州的发射台受损。</span></p><p><strong><span>【可能你也感兴趣】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f94d3de05c0efcd6e22af4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f94d3de05c0efcd6e22af4"><span>ep.33 宇树科技招股书意外揭秘机器人真相！</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69efdd4822e250916902eb9f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69efdd4822e250916902eb9f"><span>ep.32 库克的遗产：苹果如何重塑中国产业链</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e556111d989496e702589b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e556111d989496e702589b"><span>ep.31 无所不能的AI为什么学不会张曼玉流泪？一滴泪折射出的AI瓶颈</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69de5c9ae2c8be3155372d65" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69de5c9ae2c8be3155372d65"><span>ep.30 千问要收费，阿里重大调整：不再开源做善事，大模型商业时代正式开始！</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c0